abstract: >-
  A deterministic diagonal perturbation for normalized Hermitian tridiagonal
  matrices in a specified exact-real arithmetic model, with a separate
  finite-bit construction, exact certificates and a formal scalar and
  polynomial core. The manuscript license is TBD.
